          "en": "to identify this document which you wanna update.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.06,
          "end": 81,
          "en": "So, here, of course, I wanna use the id I got here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81,
          "end": 83.82,
          "en": "However, this will be an id as a string,",
