        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 139.42000000000002,
          "end": 142.05,
          "en": "That this will always be a string, therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 142.05,
          "end": 144.52,
          "en": "That's a tiny adjustment we'll need to make here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 144.52,
          "end": 147.16,
          "en": "Otherwise, we'll get an error later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 147.16,
          "end": 148.98,
          "en": "With that, we can add the second argument,",
