          "end": 194.68,
          "en": "Here, I'm not even interested in the result of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 194.68,
          "end": 198.193,
          "en": "because I, thereafter, just set back a response like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 199.44,
          "end": 202.91,
          "en": "Now, for deleting, it's quite similar to updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 202.91,
          "end": 207.25,
          "en": "Here, we can replace this code, call getDb,",
